          "inventory_expansion_required": false,
          "statement": "Fix a length $R_0>0$, set $E=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^3:|x|>R_0\\}$, and let $x_*=(3R_0,0,0)$. Define\n$$\\phi(x)=\\begin{cases}\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{1}{1-|x-x_*|^2/R_0^2}\\right),&|x-x_*|<R_0,\\\\0,&|x-x_*|\\ge R_0.\\end{cases}$$\nFor $0<\\varepsilon<1$, set $u_0=1$, $u_\\varepsilon=1+\\varepsilon\\phi$, $h_0=u_0^4\\delta$, $h_\\varepsilon=u_\\varepsilon^4\\delta$, and $K_0=K_\\varepsilon=0$ on $E$. Both data sets have the same fixed-chart ADM energy, $0$, but their scalar curvatures differ at $x_*$.",
