ee, so the displayed connection and curvature arrays patch consistently over the quotient atlas. This is a local $C^2$ extension for this fixed atlas; no general low-regularity tensoriality theorem is being assumed. It inherits only $\\mathrm{AC}_\\omega$ from the torus and product definitions.",
