          "statement": "For the semisimple closed model defined by the stated idempotent data, let $H=\\mu\\circ\\Delta$ and let $g\\ge0$ be an integer. The connected closed genus-$g$ amplitude is $Z_A(\\Sigma_g)=\\sum_{i=1}^{r}w_i^{1-g}$. The cylinder acts by $1_A$, and the torus amplitude is $r$.",
