          "inventory_expansion_required": false,
          "statement": "For the semisimple closed model determined by the stated idempotent data, define $a^*=\\sum_i\\overline{a_i}e_i$ when $a=\\sum_i a_i e_i$, and set $h(a,b)=\\epsilon(a^*b)$. The form $h$ is a Hermitian positive-definite inner product exactly when every weight $w_i$ is a positive real number. The algebraic closed oriented TQFT exists for every nonzero complex weight; positivity is an additional condition for this specified Hilbert-space interpretation.",
