                "url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/22-103-microscopic-theory-of-transport-fall-2003/42a7a0ddcb94eb23f6c096ae04da0162_lec3.pdf",
                "locator": "Lecture 3, equations (3.1)–(3.8): fluid-particle velocity autocorrelation, time-translation invariance (3.3), and mean-square displacement (3.6); a classical analogy, not a lattice charge-current result."
              }
