          "statement": "On any smooth manifold $M$, if a smooth one-form $\\omega$ is exact, so $\\omega=d\\phi$ for a globally defined smooth scalar $\\phi:M\\to\\mathbb R$, then $\\operatorname{Per}_\\gamma(\\omega)=0$ for every closed piecewise-$C^1$ curve $\\gamma$ in $M$.",
