          "physical_scope": "A conditional exact calculation for the adopted continuous genus-zero JT disk density, at fixed $C$ and $S_0$ in $c=\\hbar=k_B=1$ units. It does not assert a discrete microscopic spectrum, a higher-topology result, a nonperturbative completion, or empirical validity.\n",
